{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frog Knight is a precision platformer that blends tight jumps, skill progression, and challenging vertical level design, all wrapped in a pixel-art fantasy world with a touch of humor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897830/extras/3765fde969bf6c3f9614b72678133357.poster.avif?t=1756322784\" width=780 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897830/extras/3765fde969bf6c3f9614b72678133357.webm?t=1756322784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Sword &amp; Movement Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Power of the Bounce: </strong>Strike floating orbs with your talking sword to launch yourself upward. Every hit changes your trajectory. Mastering timing is the key to progress. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock New Abilities: </strong>Discover upgrades that expand your movement toolkit, such as Wall Jump and Power Bounce. These not only open new paths but also help you recover after a devastating fall. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Relentless Vertical World: </strong>The well is one massive level without checkpoints where every mistake costs real progress. Patience, skill, and persistence are your only allies. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fall hurts, but sharpens your mastery. Frog Knight is about persistence, precision, and the satisfaction of progressing with perfect jumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only those who persevere will uncover the Truth that lies beyond the summit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto